===============================================================================
PROVENANCE OF THIS LICENCE  --  NOT PART OF THE LICENCE TERMS
===============================================================================

Read this first. It is the record a future reader, acquirer or lawyer will look
for, and it is why this relicence is clean.

This repository carried an Apache-2.0 LICENSE file internally from its first
commit until 2026-07-29. That grant never reached anyone, because the software
was never distributed. Verified on 2026-07-29:

  * The repository github.com/ddickmann/latence-framework has been PRIVATE
    since it was created on 2026-07-06, has never been made public, and has
    zero forks (GitHub API: "isPrivate": true, "forkCount": 0).
  * Nothing has ever been published to PyPI. All 33 distribution names under
    packages/, plus the root project name latence-framework-dev, were queried
    against the PyPI index and every one returned 404 — no project, no release,
    no sdist, no wheel. (Separately: the unrelated name "latence" on PyPI is a
    different project of the same owner, the MIT-licensed Latence TRACE SDK from
    github.com/latenceainew/latence-trace-python. No code from this repository
    is in it.)
  * No GitHub Release has ever been created, and the repository holds no
    version tag matching "v*".
  * Every commit in the repository's history — 479 on `main` at the time of
    the relicence — was authored by Dennis Dickmann. Three Git identities
    appear (ddickmann, latenceainew, and the GitHub no-reply address of the
    same account); all resolve to the same person and the same address,
    ddickmann81@gmail.com. There are no third-party contributions and no
    contributor licence agreements to reconcile.

Dennis Dickmann is therefore the sole copyright holder in this work and is free
to license it on any terms. No one holds a prior Apache-2.0 grant in this
software, because no one ever received a copy of it under that grant. The
earlier Apache-2.0 file is superseded, not revoked from anybody.

This note records verifiable facts about the repository. It is not legal advice
and has not been reviewed by counsel. See COMMERCIAL.md, section "Legal review",
for what still needs a lawyer.

