    https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0.txt

retrieved 2026-07-29. SPDX identifier: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0.

Everything between the BEGIN marker line and the END marker line is that file
byte for byte, including its trailing newline. Its SHA-256 is

    ffcca38841adb694b6f380647e15f17c446a4d1656fed51a1e2041d064c94cc8

which is also the SHA-256 of the steward's file as published. A test in this
repository recomputes it on every run
(packages/latence-core/tests/test_publish_readiness.py), so an edited clause
fails the build instead of shipping.

Nothing outside the markers modifies the licence. The licensor is Dennis
Dickmann, and the Required Notice line at the top of this file is the
plain-text notice the "Notices" section refers to: it must travel with any copy
you distribute.

